WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.544
[Music builds]

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:05.839
I'm Kelly Slater, I've been on
the world surf tour for

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:08.967
30 years now.

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:12.429
When do you think you'll retire?

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:13.763
I'm tired, you know?

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:16.725
So many contests, so much focus,
so much discipline…

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:17.892
It takes a toll on you.

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:23.898
Aloha from the North Shore.

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:26.109
Yeah, here we are.
Season 2.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.819
I guess we weren't that bad.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:28.737
[Laughs]

00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:31.281
The energy level that I'm feeling

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:32.782
is off the charts.

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:35.869
- You definitely get the goosebumps.
- [Laughs]

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.290
This year we've got the cut.
After 5 events

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.793
we're cutting the field down
to 22 men and 10 women.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:48.798
If you don't make the cut
that's a huge mark on your career.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.718
The cut's not fair for a lot of people.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.806
Gabriel, he's the man and
he's the guy to beat,

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:58.933
but this is my time.

00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:00.977
Toledo! Unbelievable!

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:03.772
Gabriel's already had his world titles.
Time for me to get one.

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.233
I want to win more than anything.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.068
This is pressure like we've never seen.

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.779
It can be intimidating.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:13.031
The fear, people react to it different.

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.073
I'm dead last.

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:15.658
If I don't make it here,

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:16.743
it's done.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.536
It's like, I'm off tour.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:22.373
He's not coming here
to participate.

00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:23.458
He's coming here to win.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.168
Kelly Slater, again!

00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:28.046
Tatiana is below the cut line.
She got an injury.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:29.214
Her career is at stake.

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:30.965
It's time to put your head down

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:31.674
and make a run for it.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.512
You wanna perform
on the big stage,

00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:37.388
and this is the biggest
stage you can have.

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:40.183
This is sport history.

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:42.477
- Oh my goodness. 
- Oh!!

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:45.855
That was amazing!

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:50.109
[Music continues] 

